  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accountable grant to support smallholder farmers to produce tea in line with best practice &#x2013; CDEL 70%</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support smallholder farmers to produce tea in line with best practice, scale-up the model, address key constraints in the existing locations and enhance the climate sustainability of the tea sector through the provision of technical assistance, extension services and patient capital.</narrative>
  </description>
